        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia #25, Stainless Steel Door Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia #25 Stainless Steel Lever features a 2 piece lever and stem design making it the popular choice of interior design professionals. It is available in either Bright Polished or Satin Brushed Stainless finishes to match your room's decor. Easy to install, this is a long-lasting stainless steel door lever for commercial or residential doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-57004-SM.jpg?v=1704354616\" width=\"358\" height=\"168\" border=\"0\" alt=\"OMN 25 Lever Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: New <a href=\"/products/designer-stainless-steel-door-lever-set-with-square-rose-omnia-25s\"><b>Omnia #25S Lever with Contemporary Square Rose</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Designer Stainless Steel Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Residential and Commercial Doors</li>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia #25 Designer Stainless Steel Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Diameter (thickness): 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-7/16\"</li> \r\n<li>Rose Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\" and 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch: 28 Degrees Retraction </li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard 2-1/8\" inch door bore</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on one side of the door. Package Includes: 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 rosettes, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, solid spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, slit spindle, and mounting screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Designer Stainless Steel Door Lever Set",
                "description": "The Omnia #25 Stainless Steel Lever features a 2 piece lever and stem design making it the popular choice of interior design professionals. It is available in either Bright Polished or Satin Brushed Stainless finishes to match your room's decor. Easy to install, this is a long-lasting stainless steel door lever for commercial or residential doors. \r\n",
